<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>二信高中遲到登記系統</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="./style.css" />
</head>
<body>
  <main class="card">
    <h1>二信高中遲到登記系統</h1>
    <p class="sub">請填寫班級、姓名、學號。登記時間會在送出時自動記錄。</p>

    <form id="lateForm">
      <label>班級（必填）
        <input name="class" placeholder="例：二信電機二甲" required />
      </label>

      <label>姓名（必填）
        <input name="name" placeholder="例：王小明" required />
      </label>

      <label>學號（必填）
        <input name="studentId" placeholder="例：11208123" required />
      </label>

      <button id="submitBtn" type="submit">送出登記</button>
      <p id="msg" class="msg" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </form>

    <footer class="footer">
      <span id="time"></span>
    </footer>
  </main>

  <script src="./app.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
